#  Glossy Slate 1.0 for Rockbox – iPod Classic 6G/7G (fork, 320 x 240)
#  Status bar skin (.sbs): menus, lists, sidebar, lock screen, USB. Built from the Glossy Slate design canvas.
#  Layering notes: see DESIGN.md, section "Skin technique".
#
%Fl(2,16-GlossySlate-Bold13.fnt,160)
%Fl(3,20-GlossySlate-Bold17.fnt,160)
